(3533371, 494298, 68947, '<td valign="top">Oooooo.......quite gorey!  Really captures a message though.  Are you getting many comments about the gore to this shot?  Seems like a lot of voters in these challenges don''t like "off beat" type of shots.  They seem to prefer the "usual" flowers, nice mountain scenery, well done studio work. I''ve found that with my own experiences in entries and it sure as heck takes away the "creativity", doesn''t it?  I''m finding that I''m losing my own sense of style and imagery through trying to "please the masses".  Unfortunately, I don''t live in a "pretty environment" with mountains/desert scenes and the flowers aren''t out yet as it''s not "blossom season" yet, so I''m finding myself being creative with my messages and it''s not going over well with voters. Pretty discouraging.  7 from me for your creativity.  Best of wishes. BTW.....I''m scoring lower on those who simply have a "nice chain shot" no matter HOW technically well done it is! I''m tired of the same old types of "good shots".</td>', 'Oooooo.......quite gorey!  Really captures a message though.  Are you getting many comments about the gore to this shot?  Seems like a lot of voters in these challenges don''t like "off beat" type of shots.  They seem to prefer the "usual" flowers, nice mountain scenery, well done studio work. I''ve found that with my own experiences in entries and it sure as heck takes away the "creativity", doesn''t it?  I''m finding that I''m losing my own sense of style and imagery through trying to "please the masses".  Unfortunately, I don''t live in a "pretty environment" with mountains/desert scenes and the flowers aren''t out yet as it''s not "blossom season" yet, so I''m finding myself being creative with my messages and it''s not going over well with voters. Pretty discouraging.  7 from me for your creativity.  Best of wishes. BTW.....I''m scoring lower on those who simply have a "nice chain shot" no matter HOW technically well done it is! I''m tired of the same old types of "good shots".', '2007-04-09 16:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3533375, 493561, 3746, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of this kind of processing. However, good concept, the model has nailed the look in his eyes. The earring is a wee bit ditracting. But the lighting is spot-on. going with a 6 initially but may welll bump on the 2nd pass (I am only on image 18 at the moment, so long way to go yet!)<br/> <br/>6<br/> <br/>OK, 2nd time around. Now, compared to a lot of the other shots in the challenge this actually does stand out a bit more than it did initially. However. I really am not entirely convinced with the processing, its seems to of been done this way for the sake of it, not to embellish the `chain` subject it is supposed to be describing. I am bumping this up 2 points BUT not for the processing, but for the idea, and mainly because the model really has nailed `the look`. You owe him 2 points worth of beers.  8   well done.</td>', 'Not a big fan of this kind of processing. However, good concept, the model has nailed the look in his eyes. The earring is a wee bit ditracting. But the lighting is spot-on. going with a 6 initially but may welll bump on the 2nd pass (I am only on image 18 at the moment, so long way to go yet!) 6 OK, 2nd time around. Now, compared to a lot of the other shots in the challenge this actually does stand out a bit more than it did initially. However. I really am not entirely convinced with the processing, its seems to of been done this way for the sake of it, not to embellish the `chain` subject it is supposed to be describing. I am bumping this up 2 points BUT not for the processing, but for the idea, and mainly because the model really has nailed `the look`. You owe him 2 points worth of beers.  8   well done.', '2007-04-09 16:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3533376, 493639, 25166, '<td valign="top">Siouxsie and the Banshees?</td>', 'Siouxsie and the Banshees?', '2007-04-09 16:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3533377, 494210, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, not really a hard hitting picture. it meets the challenge, barely, but is a pleasent shot to look at, and the technicals are all correct. 7</td>', 'OK, not really a hard hitting picture. it meets the challenge, barely, but is a pleasent shot to look at, and the technicals are all correct. 7', '2007-04-09 16:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3533378, 493198, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ok, this one had me chuckling! I love your concept and the shot is a great shot!  Nice clarity, color and composition, but more than anything, this has a really creative message behind it!  I''m scoring lower on the traditional "technically well shot chain shots" this time.  We need more "creative shots" in these challenges now rather than just "technically good" with no creativity behind it.  Nice shot!  8 from me on this one.  Let''s push the "creative buttons" now rather than the just "technically good" shots (even though this IS "technically good"!!) :)</td>', 'Ok, this one had me chuckling! I love your concept and the shot is a great shot!  Nice clarity, color and composition, but more than anything, this has a really creative message behind it!  I''m scoring lower on the traditional "technically well shot chain shots" this time.  We need more "creative shots" in these challenges now rather than just "technically good" with no creativity behind it.  Nice shot!  8 from me on this one.  Let''s push the "creative buttons" now rather than the just "technically good" shots (even though this IS "technically good"!!) :)', '2007-04-09 16:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3533379, 494549, 3746, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of shots like this in the challenge, and whilst this isnt the best, it certainly isnt the worst. 6</td>', 'There are a lot of shots like this in the challenge, and whilst this isnt the best, it certainly isnt the worst. 6', '2007-04-09 16:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3533380, 494695, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, this is my 2nd time around voting in this challenge and initially I gave it a 6, after seeing the rest of the images I am bumping to a 7.  nice strong lighting and great composition. well done.</td>', 'OK, this is my 2nd time around voting in this challenge and initially I gave it a 6, after seeing the rest of the images I am bumping to a 7.  nice strong lighting and great composition. well done.', '2007-04-09 16:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
