(3533394, 494694, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, this is a strong shot, however the model looks more like he is laughing than desperately trying to escape, this really kills the shot for me.<br/> <br/>&lt;2 mins later&gt;<br/> <br/>OK, I keep staring at this shot but it really does look like he is laughing. This could do well as the image has a nice look to it, but my eyes keep wandering back to his `laugh`. 6 (but may bump on 2nd pass)<br/> <br/> <br/>&lt;10 hours later&gt;<br/> <br/>OK, back again, I am bumping this to a 7.  model still looks like he is laughing though.</td>', 'OK, this is a strong shot, however the model looks more like he is laughing than desperately trying to escape, this really kills the shot for me. <2 mins later> OK, I keep staring at this shot but it really does look like he is laughing. This could do well as the image has a nice look to it, but my eyes keep wandering back to his `laugh`. 6 (but may bump on 2nd pass)  <10 hours later> OK, back again, I am bumping this to a 7.  model still looks like he is laughing though.', '2007-04-09 16:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3533395, 494407, 3746, '<td valign="top">nice framing and nice contrast of colours. 6</td>', 'nice framing and nice contrast of colours. 6', '2007-04-09 16:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3533396, 494744, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, lots of shots like this, but the rust and bad condition of the chain works well here, chains are supposed to be strong, but this looks like it could be bitten through. one of the best shots of this type in the challenge, but ultimately will fall by the wayside due to the prevalence of many many similar shots.<br/> <br/>7</td>', 'OK, lots of shots like this, but the rust and bad condition of the chain works well here, chains are supposed to be strong, but this looks like it could be bitten through. one of the best shots of this type in the challenge, but ultimately will fall by the wayside due to the prevalence of many many similar shots. 7', '2007-04-09 16:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3533398, 494757, 3746, '<td valign="top">not bad. not best of challenge but well above average. bumping to 7</td>', 'not bad. not best of challenge but well above average. bumping to 7', '2007-04-09 16:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
