(3540229, 494668, 52500, '<td valign="top">Now that is one evil looking weapon!  Very nice presentation.  DOF, lighting, toning all look great to me.</td>', 'Now that is one evil looking weapon!  Very nice presentation.  DOF, lighting, toning all look great to me.', '2007-04-11 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3540235, 493748, 52500, '<td valign="top">Looks like an eyewave shot.  If that''s not you, take that as a compliment!  Very well done.</td>', 'Looks like an eyewave shot.  If that''s not you, take that as a compliment!  Very well done.', '2007-04-11 17:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3540239, 492691, 52500, '<td valign="top">Now this is amazingly visually interesting!  I love the shallow DOF.  Back to bumpiddy bump you up!  1 of my 3 10s.</td>', 'Now this is amazingly visually interesting!  I love the shallow DOF.  Back to bumpiddy bump you up!  1 of my 3 10s.', '2007-04-11 17:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3540246, 494752, 52500, '<td valign="top">Everything about this photo is fantastic.  The key for me, which it appears that you obviously intended, is the fact that he totally looks like he is swinging, but the chains aren''t connected to anything!  Wow, that''s an ugly sentence.  Well, you know what I mean.</td>', 'Everything about this photo is fantastic.  The key for me, which it appears that you obviously intended, is the fact that he totally looks like he is swinging, but the chains aren''t connected to anything!  Wow, that''s an ugly sentence.  Well, you know what I mean.', '2007-04-11 17:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3540248, 493258, 52500, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The tone-mapping really works here.  My only gripe is it feels like it could use a little CCW rotate to me.  Other than that, fantastic idea and excecution!  Bumped ya to a 9.</td>', 'Very nice.  The tone-mapping really works here.  My only gripe is it feels like it could use a little CCW rotate to me.  Other than that, fantastic idea and excecution!  Bumped ya to a 9.', '2007-04-11 17:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
