(3545347, 493466, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love this - it''s hilarious!  I think you have to have kids to truly appreciate this one.</td>', 'I love this - it''s hilarious!  I think you have to have kids to truly appreciate this one.', '2007-04-13 11:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545353, 494684, 67697, '<td valign="top">That is so cool - I had no idea we could get the necklace!  I want one now.  I hope people get what this is in reference too. The love story was one great underlying theme in LOTR (bad me - I did not read any books beyond the Hobbit).  As for the photo lol, I love the sharpness and detail of the hand and necklace.  It''s in your face with a subtle message.  Love it!</td>', 'That is so cool - I had no idea we could get the necklace!  I want one now.  I hope people get what this is in reference too. The love story was one great underlying theme in LOTR (bad me - I did not read any books beyond the Hobbit).  As for the photo lol, I love the sharpness and detail of the hand and necklace.  It''s in your face with a subtle message.  Love it!', '2007-04-13 11:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545354, 493258, 67697, '<td valign="top">Is this candid or staged?  If candid - what a catch.  And there is probably an interesting story to be told.  I am guessing this is staged, which to me says you had a great idea, put it together well, and came up with a nice presentation.  Good luck!</td>', 'Is this candid or staged?  If candid - what a catch.  And there is probably an interesting story to be told.  I am guessing this is staged, which to me says you had a great idea, put it together well, and came up with a nice presentation.  Good luck!', '2007-04-13 11:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545356, 493968, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is great, you have more than just a chain.  Lots of emotion with your picture.  Love the lighting of the whole pic.</td>', 'This is great, you have more than just a chain.  Lots of emotion with your picture.  Love the lighting of the whole pic.', '2007-04-13 11:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545358, 494799, 67697, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Thank god this is not how chain mails are really sent.  Love the spot lighting.</td>', 'Funny!  Thank god this is not how chain mails are really sent.  Love the spot lighting.', '2007-04-13 11:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545361, 494458, 67697, '<td valign="top">I hope you get a chance to go back and take a pic with out the chain and anchor in the way.  Looks like the background could be gorgeous!  Thinking in terms of the challenge topic, I actually think the background kind of takes away from the subject.  And the flash on the chain does not blend in well with the natural lighting of the rest of the pic.  I gave it a 7 irregardless because you have a lot of neat stuff here.  Good luck!</td>', 'I hope you get a chance to go back and take a pic with out the chain and anchor in the way.  Looks like the background could be gorgeous!  Thinking in terms of the challenge topic, I actually think the background kind of takes away from the subject.  And the flash on the chain does not blend in well with the natural lighting of the rest of the pic.  I gave it a 7 irregardless because you have a lot of neat stuff here.  Good luck!', '2007-04-13 11:08:42.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3545364, 494209, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the soft background of flowers.  It''s more than just a chain, and that is what makes this stand out from some of the other pictures.</td>', 'I love the composition and the soft background of flowers.  It''s more than just a chain, and that is what makes this stand out from some of the other pictures.', '2007-04-13 11:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545366, 494752, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a fun and happy picture.  Love the concept with the swing - how many shots did you have to take? lol.  The background is just perfect too.  Good luck!</td>', 'What a fun and happy picture.  Love the concept with the swing - how many shots did you have to take? lol.  The background is just perfect too.  Good luck!', '2007-04-13 11:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545370, 494030, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love this mysterious photo.  The softness and the spot lighting add to the magic.  Good luck - hope this does well!</td>', 'I love this mysterious photo.  The softness and the spot lighting add to the magic.  Good luck - hope this does well!', '2007-04-13 11:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545521, 493198, 811, '<td valign="top">funny!!!</td>', 'funny!!!', '2007-04-13 12:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545697, 494720, 68586, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing and composition. As this is advanced editing, i think I would have liked to see the light area around the chain saw darkened to help it stand out more. But that might just be me.</td>', 'Interesting framing and composition. As this is advanced editing, i think I would have liked to see the light area around the chain saw darkened to help it stand out more. But that might just be me.', '2007-04-13 13:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545698, 494698, 68586, '<td valign="top">This is technically well shot, but to my mind unpleasant.</td>', 'This is technically well shot, but to my mind unpleasant.', '2007-04-13 14:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545705, 494671, 68586, '<td valign="top">Well lit and taken, but she doesn''t seemed to be chained for any purpose ? <br/> <br/>Just sitting there looking clean and pretty with some chains on.</td>', 'Well lit and taken, but she doesn''t seemed to be chained for any purpose ?  Just sitting there looking clean and pretty with some chains on.', '2007-04-13 14:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3545715, 494205, 5792, '<td valign="top">Positives:<br/>This is a very nice idea. Provides the viewer with something to think about. Nice clean simplistic image without a lot of distracting details. Simple is always good. Generally well done. <br/> <br/>Technicals:<br/>Composition and framing are good. Sharpness is fine with the exception of some sharpening artifacts on the lower part of the arm. Tones are very smooth.<br/> <br/>Not lots wrong technically. Looks like the image may be a little ''flat'' where it does not contain the full range from black to white from 0,0,0 to 255,255,255. The bottom chain may be a little to close to the edge of the frame. This image depends on its simple clean lines for its effect so as a result there are some minor details that act as distractions. There are three shadow and arm lines that show up on the forearm that act as distractions.<br/> <br/>The Challenge:<br/>Obviously meets the challenge. DPC voters require literal topic interpretations and including the physical chain accomplishes that. But because of the nature of the challenge some voters might have become jaded after viewing a lot of images containing chains and wanted even more unusual compositions than this. Hard to say, though.<br/> <br/>Undoubtably the wimpy arm lacking chiseled muscular features had a negative impact on your score. ;)<br/> <br/>Suggestions:<br/>Check the luminosity range of the image to be sure it covers the full range from 0,0,0 to 255,255,255. It will add more ''punch'' to the composition. Dodge and burn for images like this are always liked by DPC voters so you might want to try doing some of that. It provides additional viewer interest. Adding a vignette border is a common photographer trick to increase image visual interest as well that you might consider. Flex those muscles!</td>', 'Positives:This is a very nice idea. Provides the viewer with something to think about. Nice clean simplistic image without a lot of distracting details. Simple is always good. Generally well done.  Technicals:Composition and framing are good. Sharpness is fine with the exception of some sharpening artifacts on the lower part of the arm. Tones are very smooth. Not lots wrong technically. Looks like the image may be a little ''flat'' where it does not contain the full range from black to white from 0,0,0 to 255,255,255. The bottom chain may be a little to close to the edge of the frame. This image depends on its simple clean lines for its effect so as a result there are some minor details that act as distractions. There are three shadow and arm lines that show up on the forearm that act as distractions. The Challenge:Obviously meets the challenge. DPC voters require literal topic interpretations and including the physical chain accomplishes that. But because of the nature of the challenge some voters might have become jaded after viewing a lot of images containing chains and wanted even more unusual compositions than this. Hard to say, though. Undoubtably the wimpy arm lacking chiseled muscular features had a negative impact on your score. ;) Suggestions:Check the luminosity range of the image to be sure it covers the full range from 0,0,0 to 255,255,255. It will add more ''punch'' to the composition. Dodge and burn for images like this are always liked by DPC voters so you might want to try doing some of that. It provides additional viewer interest. Adding a vignette border is a common photographer trick to increase image visual interest as well that you might consider. Flex those muscles!', '2007-04-13 14:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
