(3550335, 494544, 53316, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait - so full of life! I love that it looks professional without looking too neat imaged or perfect or processed.  The pose and smile are just amazing.  One of my top five images in this challenge! 10.</td>', 'Fantastic portrait - so full of life! I love that it looks professional without looking too neat imaged or perfect or processed.  The pose and smile are just amazing.  One of my top five images in this challenge! 10.', '2007-04-15 23:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
