(3550612, 494104, 60495, '<td valign="top">Wow, thanks for the comments, this one scored much higher than anticipated and placing forth is great.  I took this with a Canon sure shot that I use when I do home inspection and really entered it just thinking it would get a 5.5 at best.  It is going to be hard to convince my wife I need a new lense for my slr now!  lol<br/> <br/>The deep is as in freeze, it was fun to see others thought it looked underwater because as I processed it it kinda looked that way so that is how it got the title.   Thanks again.</td>', 'Wow, thanks for the comments, this one scored much higher than anticipated and placing forth is great.  I took this with a Canon sure shot that I use when I do home inspection and really entered it just thinking it would get a 5.5 at best.  It is going to be hard to convince my wife I need a new lense for my slr now!  lol The deep is as in freeze, it was fun to see others thought it looked underwater because as I processed it it kinda looked that way so that is how it got the title.   Thanks again.', '2007-04-16 01:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
