(3552061, 494458, 19436, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your blue ribbon. I probably should have commented<br/>during the voting so sorry for this late comment.<br/>Excellent composition, exposure is great. The fill flash is a little<br/>too bright for my taste but that''s the worst I can say about it.<br/>Nice Work.</td>', 'Congrats on your blue ribbon. I probably should have commentedduring the voting so sorry for this late comment.Excellent composition, exposure is great. The fill flash is a littletoo bright for my taste but that''s the worst I can say about it.Nice Work.', '2007-04-16 13:13:24.000000', NULL, 0),
