(3556732, 493962, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like basic bold complementary colors of this and the simple composition.  And I liked the off-beat idea of a chain letter. I gave it a 6. It definitely did not deserve all those 1s and 2s -- there''s nothing bad about the photo, and it meets the challenge nicely.</td>', 'I like basic bold complementary colors of this and the simple composition.  And I liked the off-beat idea of a chain letter. I gave it a 6. It definitely did not deserve all those 1s and 2s -- there''s nothing bad about the photo, and it meets the challenge nicely.', '2007-04-17 23:33:23.000000', NULL, 0),
