(3626454, 493224, 73032, '<td valign="top">looking back on it now, I see that the black spots didn''t look that good. I thought they looked like hills before. You know, like a snake going thru the hills, or black sand... oh well, live and learn.</td>', 'looking back on it now, I see that the black spots didn''t look that good. I thought they looked like hills before. You know, like a snake going thru the hills, or black sand... oh well, live and learn.', '2007-05-07 22:53:50.000000', NULL, 0),
