(3695392, 494801, 78766, '<td valign="top">cute shot but needs some work. first id rearrange them so the longest are on both ends and the smallest in the middle.<br/>then photoshop time, u gotta adjust color balance and brighten it up. Up the contrast just a bit and then crop it tighter till its almost like a pano shot.<br/> <br/>really cute idea showing all the little toys kids collect. I might try this with my daughters junk errr treasures.</td>', 'cute shot but needs some work. first id rearrange them so the longest are on both ends and the smallest in the middle.then photoshop time, u gotta adjust color balance and brighten it up. Up the contrast just a bit and then crop it tighter till its almost like a pano shot. really cute idea showing all the little toys kids collect. I might try this with my daughters junk errr treasures.', '2007-05-25 17:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3763563, 494701, 55838, '<td valign="top">Love the very shallow DOF and the rusty tones.  Possibly not exciting enough composition to merit a tremendous score (not a bad score though!).  As an aside: Sister you are really good at this shallow DOF thing - I''d love to see ya shoot some vibrantly colored subjects (bugs, spiders, flowers) in this style. Yeah - maybe they are generic DPC subjects etc. but I just think you are good at the shallow DOF technique and could potentially get some excellent scores.</td>', 'Love the very shallow DOF and the rusty tones.  Possibly not exciting enough composition to merit a tremendous score (not a bad score though!).  As an aside: Sister you are really good at this shallow DOF thing - I''d love to see ya shoot some vibrantly colored subjects (bugs, spiders, flowers) in this style. Yeah - maybe they are generic DPC subjects etc. but I just think you are good at the shallow DOF technique and could potentially get some excellent scores.', '2007-06-10 16:30:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3854676, 494752, 24715, '<td valign="top">I think this is really cool shot. Excellent tones and detail. The missing head adds the motion feel as if he popped out of the frame the moment you pressed the shutter button.</td>', 'I think this is really cool shot. Excellent tones and detail. The missing head adds the motion feel as if he popped out of the frame the moment you pressed the shutter button.', '2007-07-01 19:44:43.000000', NULL, 0),
